<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Manchem explains qualified audit opinion.</title>
<headline>Manchem explains qualified audit opinion.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manga-Chem Products Ltd said on Thursday the qualification of the audit opinion on its annual financial statements related to approvals outstanding on a restructuring agreement.</p>
<p>It said it had lodged all the necessary applications for these approvals needed from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE), Securities Regulation Panel, the central Reserve Bank and shareholders.</p>
<p>The JSE said on Wednesday that Manga-Chem's listing would be annotated with a &quot;Q&quot; with effect from October 17 to indicate the qualification.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
